### SIMRS REST API — Test File
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client extension, IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Base URL: adjust @host to your Laragon URL
###
### Usage:
###   1. Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code
###   2. Click "Send Request" above each ### block
###   3. Start with Auth → Login to get session cookie
###   4. The @csrf variable must be updated from the login response

@host = http://localhost/simrs
@contentType = application/json

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. AUTH
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 Get CSRF Token (call this first)
GET {{host}}/api/csrf-token
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.2 Login
# ⚡ After running: copy the "csrf_token" from the response
# and paste it as the value of @csrf below.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

# ── Paste your CSRF token here after login ────────────────────────────────────
@csrf = PASTE_CSRF_TOKEN_HERE

### 1.3 Get Current User (check session)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.4 Register New Nakes Account
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "nama_lengkap": "dr. Budi Santoso",
  "username": "dr.budi",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "role": "Dokter"
}

###

### 1.5 Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. DASHBOARD
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 Get Dashboard Statistics
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. ADMISI / PASIEN
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3.1 List All Patients
GET {{host}}/api/pasien
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.2 Search Patients by name/NIK
GET {{host}}/api/pasien?q=Budi
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.3 Get Single Patient + Visit History
GET {{host}}/api/pasien?pasien_id=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.4 Register New Patient
POST {{host}}/api/pasien
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "nik": "3201234567890123",
  "nama": "Ahmad Fauzi",
  "jenis_kelamin": "L",
  "tanggal_lahir": "1985-06-15",
  "ihs_number": "P02478375538",
  "consent_satusehat": true
}

###

### 3.5 Toggle SATUSEHAT Consent (PATCH)
# Replace {id} with actual patient ID
PATCH {{host}}/api/pasien/1/consent
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "consent": false
}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. KLINIS / KUNJUNGAN
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4.1 Get All Visits
GET {{host}}/api/kunjungan
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.2 Get Visits by Patient
GET {{host}}/api/kunjungan?pasien_id=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.3 Store New Clinical Examination
# Expected response: 201 Created with news2 scores + satusehat push result
POST {{host}}/api/kunjungan
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "pasien_id": 1,
  "sistole": 120,
  "diastole": 80,
  "nadi": 72,
  "suhu": 36.5,
  "laju_napas": 18,
  "keluhan": "Demam dan batuk 3 hari",
  "diagnosa_icd10": "J06.9",
  "resep": [
    { "obat_id": 1, "aturan_pakai": "3x1 sesudah makan" },
    { "obat_id": 2, "aturan_pakai": "2x1 sebelum tidur" }
  ]
}

###

### 4.4 Drug Utilization Review (DUR) Check
POST {{host}}/api/kunjungan/dur
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "obat_ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

###

### 4.5 Drug Search (Autocomplete)
GET {{host}}/api/obat?q=paracet
Accept: application/json

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. INTEGRASI SATUSEHAT
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5.1 Get SATUSEHAT OAuth2 Token
# Expected: { ok: true, token: "...", expires_in: 3600, cached: false }
GET {{host}}/api/integrasi/token
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.2 Push Single Encounter by kunjungan_id
# Expected: { ok: true, encounter_id: "..." } or { ok: false, error: "..." }
POST {{host}}/api/integrasi/encounter
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "kunjungan_id": 1
}

###

### 5.3 Batch Sync (Background Sync simulation)
# This is what the JS Service Worker calls when coming back online.
# Each entry in results shows success/fail/skipped per encounter.
POST {{host}}/api/integrasi/sync
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "encounters": [
    { "kunjungan_id": 1 },
    { "kunjungan_id": 2 },
    { "kunjungan_id": 3 }
  ]
}

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. AUDIT LOG
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6.1 Get Audit Log (last 100 entries)
GET {{host}}/api/audit
Accept: application/json

###

### 6.2 Get Audit Log (custom limit)
GET {{host}}/api/audit?limit=50
Accept: application/json

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7. FARMASI
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7.1 Get All Prescriptions
GET {{host}}/api/farmasi/resep
Accept: application/json

###

### 7.2 Get Prescriptions for a Visit
GET {{host}}/api/farmasi/resep?kunjungan_id=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 7.3 Get Full Drug Catalogue (for offline pre-cache)
# Used by Phase 4 sync.js to populate IndexedDB with all drugs.
GET {{host}}/api/farmasi/obat
Accept: application/json

###

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 8. ERROR CASES (Validation)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8.1 Invalid NIK (should return 422)
POST {{host}}/api/pasien
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "nik": "123",
  "nama": "Test",
  "jenis_kelamin": "L",
  "tanggal_lahir": "1990-01-01"
}

###

### 8.2 Access protected endpoint without login (should return 401)
# (First logout with 1.5, then run this)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### 8.3 Non-existent endpoint (should return 404)
GET {{host}}/api/tidak-ada
Accept: application/json

###
